WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.268
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:03.736
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.736 --> 00:00:04.970
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:07.273
At a campaign reception
in New York yesterday,

00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:10.076
President Biden said
that former President Trump

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:12.845
is an existential threat
to the country.

00:00:12.845 --> 00:00:15.281
Not to be rude,
but we know, dude.

00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:16.850
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:19.319
That was the original
title of this show.

00:00:19.319 --> 00:00:22.154
[ Laughter ]

00:00:22.154 --> 00:00:23.589
The Super Bowl is this weekend.

00:00:23.589 --> 00:00:25.358
Some people will root
for the Chiefs,

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:26.659
some for the 49ers,

00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:29.829
but everybody will be
rooting for Taylor's plane.

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:31.597
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:31.597 --> 00:00:35.101
Come on...Taylor's plane.

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:36.835
House Democrats
yesterday kicked off

00:00:36.835 --> 00:00:39.605
their three-day
strategy retreat in Virginia,

00:00:39.605 --> 00:00:42.375
and the theme for this year's
event is "Finish the Job."

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:44.343
And Mike Pence
is really hoping

00:00:44.343 --> 00:00:46.513
that's also not
the Republicans' theme.

00:00:46.513 --> 00:00:50.283
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:52.618
When asked yesterday
why he brought the vote

00:00:52.618 --> 00:00:55.688
to impeach Homeland Security
Secretary Alejandro Mayorkas

00:00:55.688 --> 00:00:58.458
to the floor if he did not have
the votes to pass it,

00:00:58.458 --> 00:01:01.694
House Speaker Mike Johnson
said that "people show up

00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:03.629
when they're not expected
to be in the building."

00:01:03.629 --> 00:01:05.398
Yeah, that's a problem.

00:01:05.398 --> 00:01:10.036
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.036 --> 00:01:13.039
Democratic candidate Marianne
Williamson announced yesterday

00:01:13.039 --> 00:01:15.207
that she has ended
her presidential campaign.

00:01:15.207 --> 00:01:17.277
She'll now go back
to her day job,

00:01:17.277 --> 00:01:20.280
which I think is
ending presidential campaigns.

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:22.581
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.581 --> 00:01:25.551
California's senate's candidates
are set to debate later

00:01:25.551 --> 00:01:28.021
this month at Universal Studios
in Hollywood,

00:01:28.021 --> 00:01:30.456
where one is going to have
home court advantage.

00:01:30.456 --> 00:01:34.160
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.895 --> 00:01:38.097
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.097 --> 00:01:40.733
Shrek.

00:01:40.733 --> 00:01:42.868
Former Fox News host Tucker
Carlson tonight

00:01:42.868 --> 00:01:43.970
released his interview

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:45.605
with Russian President
Vladimir Putin,

00:01:45.605 --> 00:01:47.539
where he asked him all the tough
questions like,

00:01:47.539 --> 00:01:48.941
"Do you like me?" and

00:01:48.941 --> 00:01:51.377
"Okay, but do you think
you could like me?"

00:01:51.377 --> 00:01:53.713
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.713 --> 00:01:56.315
Democratic Senator
Kirsten Gillibrand

00:01:56.315 --> 00:01:58.517
hosted a bipartisan
bowling night this week

00:01:58.517 --> 00:02:00.686
at the White House,
and there was an awkward moment

00:02:00.686 --> 00:02:03.289
when someone mistook
John Fetterman for the guy

00:02:03.289 --> 00:02:04.657
who repairs the equipment.

00:02:04.657 --> 00:02:07.726
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.726 --> 00:02:09.762
Lawmakers in New Mexico
are considering

00:02:09.762 --> 00:02:12.031
making drive-up
marijuana sales legal.

00:02:12.031 --> 00:02:15.301
Until then, you'll just have
to wait until Brad's working.

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:17.803
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.803 --> 00:02:21.040
"Yeah, yeah, yeah,
here's your quarter pounder..."

00:02:23.709 --> 00:02:26.212
A Florida man was arrested
during a recent traffic stop

00:02:26.212 --> 00:02:28.447
after authorities
discovered cocaine,

00:02:28.447 --> 00:02:30.082
crystal meth, and marijuana --

00:02:30.082 --> 00:02:32.852
or, as it's called in Florida,
a balanced breakfast.

00:02:32.852 --> 00:02:36.655
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.655 --> 00:02:39.358
The Margaritaville at Sea
cruise line

00:02:39.358 --> 00:02:40.793
has announced
that it will expand

00:02:40.793 --> 00:02:43.729
its Heroes Sail Free program
for first responders.

00:02:43.729 --> 00:02:47.600
'Cause if you're going on
a Margaritaville-themed cruise,

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:50.336
you're going to want
some first responders there.

00:02:50.336 --> 00:02:52.972
[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.972 --> 00:02:55.841
A man in France was recently
denied the Guinness World Record

00:02:55.841 --> 00:02:58.978
for largest matchstick tower,
after he spent eight years

00:02:58.978 --> 00:03:01.080
building his model
of the Eiffel Tower

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:02.515
using the wrong matches.

00:03:02.515 --> 00:03:03.583
Aw, no!

00:03:03.583 --> 00:03:06.218
So you mean
that huge waste of time

00:03:06.218 --> 00:03:08.688
turned out to be
a giant waste of time?

00:03:08.688 --> 00:03:11.624
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:17.430
And finally, authorities
at the Fort Lauderdale airport

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:18.631
recently arrested a man

00:03:18.631 --> 00:03:21.067
who allegedly parked his car
on the sidewalk

00:03:21.067 --> 00:03:23.436
and then walked through
the terminal fully nude.

00:03:23.436 --> 00:03:25.838
Because Florida cops
will put up with a lot,

00:03:25.838 --> 00:03:28.174
but you just can't park
on the sidewalk.

00:03:28.174 --> 00:03:29.308
[ Laughter ]

00:03:29.308 --> 00:03:30.943
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

00:03:30.943 --> 00:03:32.412
We are off and running.

